Package: shrinkage
Title: Regularized Statistical Models
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person(
      "Johan",
      "Larsson",
      email = "johan@jolars.co",
      role = c("aut", "cre"),
      comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-4029-5945")
    )
Description: Fits regularized statistical models with penalties that shrink
    coefficients, select features, or encourage structure. Uses the Shrinkage
    Rust library for model fitting. Supports Gaussian and binomial losses,
    composable penalties, regularization paths, and cross-validation for dense
    and sparse designs.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://shrinkage.cc, https://github.com/jolars/shrinkage
BugReports: https://github.com/jolars/shrinkage/issues
